d for got missed.\\n\\n## Who I am\\nI'm the Checker. I read what the user said and what the chats did about it. If something looks dropped, I send one private note to whoever's in charge of that chat, quoting their words, and ask whether it's right. They have the full picture, so if they say it's fine, it's fine.\\n\\n## What I watch for\\nAsks that nobody picked up, and work that got called done with nothing to show for it.\\n\\n## Limits\\nI never start work, message the user, or move or close anything. One note per dump at most, and none when nothing's missed.\\n\",\"engine\":\"claude\",\"engineModel\":\"claude:grok-4.7\"},{\"id\":\"vg-game-lead\",\"name\":\"EXO lead\",\"mascot\":\"invader\",\"color\":\"hsl(211 92% 62%)\",\"projects\":[\"/Users/example/Projects/vg-game\"],\"engine\":\"claude\",\"engineModel\":\"claude:grok-4.7\"},{\"id\":\"hivra-lead\",\"name\":\"Hivra lead\",\"mascot\":\"dino\",\"color\":\"hsl(12 80% 58%)\",\"projects\":[\"/Users/example/Projects/hivra\"],\"engine\":\"claude\",\"engineModel\":\"claude:grok-4.7\"},{\"id\":\"nibbii-lead\",\"name\":\"Nibbii lead\",\"mascot\":\"robot\",\"color\":\"hsl(45 90% 55%)\",\"projects\":[\"/Users/example/Projects/nibbii\"],\"engine\":\"claude\",\"engineModel\":\"claude:grok-4.7\"},{\"id\":\"hub-lead\",\"name\":\"MonoCode Hub lead\",\"mascot\":\"cat\",\"color\":\"hsl(142 55% 50%)\",\"projects\":[\"/Users/example/Projects/monocode-hub\"],\"engine\":\"claude\",\"engineModel\":\"claude:grok-4.7\"},{\"id\":\"tally-lead\",\"name\":\"Tally lead\",\"mascot\":\"crab\",\"color\":\"hsl(330 70% 62%)\",\"projects\":[\"/private/var/folders/b4/8qh0t36j0_g9srqzx1g5t3z40000gn/T/monocode-realtest-LTcosa/projects/tally\"],\"engine\":\"claude\",\"engineModel\":\"claude:grok-4.7\"}]",
